<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's cement Asmar raises 1996 profits.</title>
<headline>Morocco's cement Asmar raises 1996 profits.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moroccan cement firm Asmar said on Wednesday its profits rose to 58 million dirhams in 1996 from 41 million dirhams the year before.</p>
<p>Turnover for 1996 was 436.9 million dirhams from 396.5 million dirhams in 1995.</p>
<p>The stock was traded at 720 dirhams on Wednesday.</p>
<p>($ = 9.2 dirhams)</p>
